1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
This is a sample transcript for offline plan testing.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
The real project works with any subject and does not assume a particular topic.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Clip planning is separated from local video rendering.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
That means you can inspect the plan before spending time on encoding.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
You can also render the same plan again without another model request.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Montage clips use source footage and ordinary text overlays.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Timing validation keeps audio video and subtitles aligned.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
This sample is intentionally generic so it can be reused in tests and examples.
